1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,010
It was around midday when I left
Ankober. Just one backpack.

2
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,982
A friend had come to see me off.

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:14,804
The road was gravel as far as Debre
Birhan. After that, asphalt.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:22,160
I sat by the window of the bus. Outside,
forest and mountains.

5
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,811
The view was amazing.

6
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:29,740
It was night when I reached Lamberet. My
friend was waiting for me.

7
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:34,176
So many people, lights on the buildings,
so many cars.

8
00:00:40,067 --> 00:00:43,927
At Autobus Tera the brokers closed in on
us.

9
00:00:43,927 --> 00:00:50,387
"Do you want a bed?" There were so many.
We were confused. We picked one.

10
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:59,455
The room had one bed. Not very good, not
bad. It was clean.

11
00:01:00,358 --> 00:01:04,308
In the morning we stood in a long queue
and got the ticket.

12
00:01:07,358 --> 00:01:12,648
If I met that boy today, I would tell
him just one thing:

13
00:01:12,648 --> 00:01:13,448
experience it.

